WEBVTT

00:28:28.510 --> 00:28:31.221
I don't think there's
necessarily a one to one.

00:28:31.814 --> 00:28:34.505
I am not sure a company can be altruistic,

00:28:34.529 --> 00:28:37.358
not that we were pretending
to be altruistic.

00:28:37.382 --> 00:28:41.650
And so I could imagine,

00:28:41.674 --> 00:28:46.245
that since the company
had really built an existence

00:28:46.269 --> 00:28:50.282
of caring about people
and the community so much,

00:28:50.306 --> 00:28:54.708
that if you did anything
that looked anything like not that,

00:28:54.732 --> 00:28:56.611
that you run the risk.

00:28:58.047 --> 00:29:00.640
And I think these mission-led companies